  questionText: Arms up, wands jabbing outward this time, not in. Which signal did
    you just see?
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: In means in, out means out the direction of the jab is the whole
    difference between these two signals, so it's worth animating them back-to-back
    for comparison.
